# Redirection racine avec détection de la langue du navigateur
# Netlify reads Accept-Language and dispatches accordingly. Default = FR.
/ /nl/ 301! Language=nl
/ /en/ 301! Language=en
/ /fr/ 301!

# Alias common sitemap path
/sitemap.xml /sitemap-index.xml 301

# Force-collapse the rare 3-hop case for the legacy www host on the root URL.
# (HTTP→HTTPS upgrade remains; the www→apex+language hop is handled by Netlify's
# domain alias. This rule is a belt-and-braces defensive entry.)
https://www.tonyandson.be/ https://tonyandson.be/fr/ 301!
